    "en": {
      "trackName": "Photo Recall: Watch Game",
      "description": "Photo Recallis a simple and engaging visual memory training game.\n\nFirst, study the patterns and remember where they are located. Once the cards are hidden, flip them over to find matching pairs and complete the challenge.\n\nDesigned for quick sessions, PhotoMemory also brings memory practice to Apple Watch.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Study and remember pattern locations\n• Flip cards to find matching pairs\n• Track your moves and improve your efficiency\n• Practice visual memory during short breaks\n• Supports iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch\n• Available in English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, French, German, and Italian\n\nTake a few minutes each day to improve focus, observation, and visual memory.",
      "releaseNotes": "Photo Recall: Watch Game now supports iOS 16 and iPadOS 16, bringing fun memory challenges to more iPhone and iPad users. All existing gameplay and features remain available.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/photo-recall-watch-game/id6814077833?uo=4",
